{"id":"8d331ca88ac9759e","group":"89","path":"89/89-fact-gl-no-t-axiom.md","title":"fact-gl-no-t-axiom — GL Rejects T Axiom","display":"fact-gl-no-t-axiom — GL Rejects T Axiom","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-fact-gl-no-t-axiom","aliases":["89-fact-gl-no-t-axiom"],"display":"fact-gl-no-t-axiom — GL Rejects T Axiom","depends_on":["[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-thm-gl-soundness]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-t-axiom]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-fact-gl-no-t-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-fact-gl-no-t-axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-gl-no-t-axiom — GL Rejects T Axiom"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0157f8bea9275cf1\" href=\"?note=0157f8bea9275cf1\" title=\"89-thm-gl-soundness\">89-thm-gl-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9e7a8687a65c356f\" href=\"?note=9e7a8687a65c356f\" title=\"89-df-t-axiom\">89-df-t-axiom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal A_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the T-axiom schema.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}gl\\text{-}no\\text{-}t\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathcal A_T\\nsubseteq\\mathrm{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}gl\\text{-}no\\text{-}t\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathcal A_T\\nsubseteq\\mathrm{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> : GL逻辑 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a>)</li>\n<li>T axiom : 自反公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p \\rightarrow p\">\\(\\Box p \\rightarrow p\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9e7a8687a65c356f\" href=\"?note=9e7a8687a65c356f\" title=\"89-df-t-axiom\">89-df-t-axiom</a>)</li>\n<li>GL不包含T公理</li>\n<li>取单世界无边框架 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=\\{w\\},R=\\varnothing\">\\(W=\\{w\\},R=\\varnothing\\)</span>，并令 p 在 w 假。该框架传递且逆良基，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p\">\\(\\Box p\\)</span> 在 w 真而 p 假；由 GL 的 Kripke 可靠性，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p\\to p\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\Box p\\to p\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>，足以反驳 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathcal A_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>对标准可靠的 PA，可证句子在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 中为真；此处拒绝的是把全部内部反射实例作为 GL 定理，不能解释成“PA 可证的句子会在标准模型中为假”。</li>\n<li>来源：Boolos，第 3 章 pp.62–64、第 4 章 pp.74–77；印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-gl-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"0157f8bea9275cf1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-t-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"9e7a8687a65c356f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-t-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GL}$ : GL逻辑 (see [[89-df-gl-logic]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-t-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"9e7a8687a65c356f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"T axiom : 自反公理 $\\Box p \\rightarrow p$ (see [[89-df-t-axiom]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}gl\\text{-}no\\text{-}t\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathcal A_T\\nsubseteq\\mathrm{GL}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box p \\rightarrow p","display":false},{"tex":"W=\\{w\\},R=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box p","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box p\\to p\\notin\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false}],"bytes":1354,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-588","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-fact-gl-no-t-axiom]]"}],"outgoing":["9f00301866fbd6f0","0157f8bea9275cf1","0006800fa1c85177","9e7a8687a65c356f"]}